%% Title: Collection cycle · part 3 of 3 · cycle close, bias checks, embeddings, alerts
%% Summary: How a collection cycle's job is closed and its job-level bias checks (bias@1.5.0, with minimum samples) run once, how the rolling 24 h window checks run daily, how scoring, retries and embeddings are processed, which source-health and retention alerts the cycle timer raises, and how alerts reach the page.
%% Sources: src/workers/start.js (closeDueCyclesOnce, every 30 s), src/workers/maintenance.worker.js (daily task), src/collectors/cycle.js, src/collectors/sweep.js, src/collectors/{source-health,retention-overdue,source-alerts}.js, src/pipeline/bias.js, src/pipeline/bias-window.js, scripts/bias-window.js, src/workers/{ingest,embed}.worker.js, src/pipeline/embeddings.js, python/embeddings_service.py, src/routes/{health,bias}.js, public/js/{main,ui,utils}.js; migrations 027, 028, 032, 036, 038, 060. Spec: TECHNICAL_SPEC.md sections 9 (bias monitoring, alert flow), 12 (embeddings); PR #22 decision G2.
flowchart LR

  subgraph CLOSE["Cycle close · worker timer every 30 s"]
    direction TB
    C1["29 · claimDueCycles(): FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED,<br/>status → closing, for every cron job whose window<br/>+ 60 s grace has passed with inflight_runs ≤ 0<br/>(or past the hard cap max(15 min, 4 × window)),<br/>and every awaiting_retries job whose retries are done"]:::done
    C2["30 · posts = COUNT(DISTINCT raw_post_id)<br/>in decision_audit_log for the job"]:::done
    C3{"posts #gt; 0?"}:::done
    C4["31 · runBiasChecks(job, bias@1.5.0), once:<br/>location_concentration (content-located posts,<br/>publisher-located excluded, min 30) ·<br/>platform_sentiment_parity (categories with ≥ 10<br/>posts, at least 2) · negative_dominance (min 30)<br/>→ 3 bias_assessments rows with methodology_version_id;<br/>below a minimum: #quot;insufficient sample#quot;,<br/>no violation, no alert"]:::done
    C5["32 · each violation → one alert_events row<br/>(alert_type = the check, severity warning / critical,<br/>details.jobId)"]:::done
    C6["33 · job completed with posts_processed;<br/>on error → failed, error text scrubbed"]:::done
    C1 --> C2 --> C3
    C3 -- yes --> C4 --> C5 --> C6
    C3 -- no --> C6
  end

  subgraph OTHER["Refresh, standup and manual jobs"]
    direction TB
    J1["POST /api/refresh (triggered_by api),<br/>populate --once (standup), npm run collect (manual):<br/>one job over every source; bias checks at the end<br/>of a run that scored new posts inline; a job with<br/>reserved scoring slots still held (a refresh's ingest<br/>jobs, retries) → awaiting_retries, closed at 29-33"]:::done
  end

  subgraph WINDOW["Rolling 24 h window"]
    direction TB
    B1["bias@1.5.0 · maintenance daily task (every 24 h)<br/>and npm run bias:window:<br/>runBiasWindow() → one bias_window_runs row"]:::done
    B2["the same three checks, thresholds and<br/>minimums over every post whose sentiment<br/>decision was recorded in the last 24 h<br/>→ bias_window_assessments (append-only)"]:::done
    B3["each violation → one alert_events row<br/>with details.windowRunId"]:::done
    B1 --> B2 --> B3
  end

  subgraph HEALTH["Source and retention alerts"]
    direction TB
    H1["same 30 s timer, after the close:<br/>evaluateSourceHealth(), collecting sources:<br/>source_stale (warning, no new post within<br/>expectedNewWithinHours) · source_failing<br/>(warning, 3+ consecutive failures) ·<br/>source_refused (critical); one open per source<br/>(migration 038), resolved when it clears"]:::done
    H2["evaluateRetentionOverdue(): one critical<br/>retention_overdue per source while text is held<br/>past its window + 60 min grace; resolved<br/>(alert_resolutions) once the text is gone"]:::done
    H1 --> H2
  end

  subgraph SWEEP["Scoring, retries and sweep"]
    direction TB
    R1["34 · sweepUnscored() after each close:<br/>posts of the last 24 h (older than 5 min) with<br/>no sentiment_results row and no pending job<br/>→ ingest job (max 500)"]:::done
    R2["35 · ingest.worker: scorePost() under the post's<br/>own running job, else the current cycle;<br/>releases the reserved slot; a post whose text<br/>was removed is skipped (text_removed);<br/>embed gate relevance ≥ 1/21 (relevance@1.2.0)"]:::done
    R1 --> R2
  end

  subgraph EMBED["Embeddings"]
    direction TB
    E1["36 · embed.worker: embedPost(id)<br/>5 attempts, exponential backoff from 2 s"]:::done
    E2["37 · POST embeddings:8000/embeddings<br/>all-MiniLM-L6-v2 at the pinned revision"]:::done
    E3["38 · upsert post_embeddings VECTOR(384),<br/>methodology_version 1.0.0 only when model<br/>and revision are the registered ones; skipped<br/>when the text was removed (checked FOR SHARE,<br/>G3) or the demo post purged"]:::done
    E1 --> E2 --> E3
  end

  subgraph SURFACE["Alerts reach the page"]
